          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't Load Episodes" : {
      "comment" : "Headline of the error state on the Apple Watch episode list, shown when the watch's request for a show's episodes to the paired iPhone failed. The caption 'Tap to try again.' sits below it and the whole block is tappable. Watch headline — keep it very short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Folgen nicht geladen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Error al cargar episodios"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Échec du chargement"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Episodi non caricati"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Laden mislukt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete" : {
      "comment" : "Destructive button — the swipe action on a row of the Downloads list, and the confirming button of the delete-download dialog on the podcast detail screen. It deletes only the downloaded audio file, never the episode or the subscription. Imperative verb, short.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Löschen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminar"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supprimer"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwijder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete Download" : {
      "comment" : "Removes the downloaded audio file from the device; the episode itself stays in the app and can be downloaded again. Used as a VoiceOver custom action in the Downloads list and as a button on the Apple Watch player.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Download löschen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eliminar descarga"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Supprimer le téléchargement"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elimina download"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwijder download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double tap to change speed. Long press to match iPhone speed." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint for the playback-speed button on the Apple Watch: activating it steps to the next rate, holding it clears the watch's own rate so it follows the paired iPhone. 'Double tap' and 'long press' are VoiceOver gestures — use your language's VoiceOver wording. 'iPhone' is a product name and stays as-is. Heard, not read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zum Ändern der Geschwindigkeit doppeltippen. Gedrückt halten, um die Geschwindigkeit des iPhone zu übernehmen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca dos veces para cambiar la velocidad. Mantén pulsado para igualar la velocidad del iPhone."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Touchez deux fois pour changer de vitesse. Maintenez le doigt pour adopter la vitesse de l'iPhone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tocca due volte per cambiare velocità. Tocca due volte e tieni premuto per usare la stessa velocità di iPhone."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dubbeltik om de snelheid te wijzigen. Houd ingedrukt om de snelheid van de iPhone over te nemen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double tap to jump to this chapter" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on a chapter row on the Apple Watch: activating it moves playback to that chapter's start. 'Double tap' is the VoiceOver activation gesture. Heard, not read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doppeltippen, um zu diesem Kapitel zu springen"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Toca dos veces para ir a este capítulo"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Touchez deux fois pour accéder à ce chapitre"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tocca due volte per passare a questo capitolo"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dubbeltik om naar dit hoofdstuk te gaan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Download" : {
      "comment" : "Menu label and VoiceOver action on an episode that saves its audio for offline listening. The VERB 'to download', not a noun for the saved file; it becomes 'Remove Download' once the file exists.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Herunterladen"
          }
