    "No new episodes from your subscriptions." : {
      "comment" : "Small caption under the 'All caught up!' headline on the Apple Watch 'Recent' screen. 'Subscriptions' means the podcasts (shows) the user follows. Tiny caption text on a watch screen — a long translation wraps badly or is truncated.",
