    "No Source" : {
      "comment" : "Status shown on the Apple Watch player when the episode has neither a downloaded file nor a streaming URL, so nothing can be played. 'Source' means where the audio would come from. Screen space on the watch is very tight — keep it to about two short words.",
      "localizations" : {
