            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Speelt nu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now Playing on iPhone, %@, %@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "watchOS VoiceOver label for the row showing what the paired iPhone is currently playing. Argument 1 is the episode title, 2 the show name, 3 a state word ('playing' or 'paused') that the app currently supplies in English. 'Now Playing' is Apple's standard term for the current-playback screen. Heard, not read.",
      "localizations" : {
