    },
    "Now Playing on Watch, %@, %@, %@" : {
      "comment" : "watchOS VoiceOver label for the row showing what the watch itself is playing (local playback, not the phone's). Argument 1 is the episode title, 2 the show name, 3 a state word ('playing' or 'paused') that the app currently supplies in English. 'Watch' is the Apple Watch device, never the verb 'to watch'; 'Now Playing' is Apple's standard term. Heard, not read.",
