    "Open YourPods on your iPhone to browse episodes." : {
      "comment" : "Small caption under the 'iPhone Not Reachable' headline on the Apple Watch episode list, telling the user to launch the app on the paired phone so the watch can fetch episodes. YourPods and iPhone are product names and are never translated. Tiny caption on a watch screen — keep it short.",
      "localizations" : {
